Source: tzf
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), cargo, rustc, clang, libclang-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/ringsaturn/pg-tzf

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-tzf
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-tzf
Depends: postgresql-PGVERSION, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Fast PG extension to lookup timezone name by GPS coordinates
  Resolve IANA timezone names from longitude/latitude coordinates in PostgreSQL.
